Security: Delete calendar subscriptions together with the account

Deleting an account removed its own calendars, address books and shares, but
not its calendar subscriptions in oc_calendarsubscriptions. An account created
later with the same user id inherited them, including the source URL - which
for many feeds contains a private access token.

The DAV hook manager now collects the account's subscriptions before the
account is deleted and removes them afterwards, like the calendars.
